  "cards":[
    {"id":"embedding-contract","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-03","context_id":"concept-embedding-contract","question":"Embedding契约包含哪些字段？","aliases":["向量模型身份怎样保存"],"keywords":["Embedding契约","字段","向量模型身份"],"diagnostic":"检查模型、版本、维度、归一化和距离。","hints":["查看 #concept-embedding-contract。","查询向量也要同契约。"],"example":"model+version+dimension+normalized+distance。","answer":"保存模型名、模型版本、维度、归一化方式和距离函数。","source":{"label":"Embedding契约","href":"#concept-embedding-contract"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"same-dimension","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-03","context_id":"concept-embedding-contract","question":"同维度的不同模型向量能混用吗？","aliases":["都是768维为什么不能放一起"],"keywords":["同维度","不同模型","混用","768维"],"diagnostic":"区分形状一致和语义空间一致。","hints":["查看 #concept-embedding-contract。","换模型创建新index。"],"example":"dimension相同不代表坐标轴相同。","answer":"不能；维度相同不代表语义空间相同，混用会让距离失去意义。","source":{"label":"Embedding契约","href":"#concept-embedding-contract"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"exact-baseline","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-03","context_id":"concept-exact-hnsw-filter","question":"为什么先保留精确向量检索基线？","aliases":["有HNSW还要exact search吗"],"keywords":["精确向量检索","基线","HNSW","exact search"],"diagnostic":"区分正确性基线和近似加速。","hints":["查看 #concept-exact-hnsw-filter。","先比较同一固定查询。"],"example":"exact作为召回参考。","answer":"精确排序提供正确性基线，才能判断HNSW调参带来的召回损失。","source":{"label":"精确HNSW与过滤","href":"#concept-exact-hnsw-filter"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"hnsw-boundary","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-03","context_id":"concept-exact-hnsw-filter","question":"HNSW为什么不是精确检索？","aliases":["HNSW召回受什么影响"],"keywords":["HNSW","精确检索","召回"],"diagnostic":"检查构建参数、ef_search和过滤。","hints":["查看 #concept-exact-hnsw-filter。","用精确基线测召回。"],"example":"近似候选可能漏掉真最近邻。","answer":"HNSW遍历近邻图而非穷举，召回受参数、数据与过滤选择性影响。","source":{"label":"精确HNSW与过滤","href":"#concept-exact-hnsw-filter"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"acl-before-vector","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-03","context_id":"concept-exact-hnsw-filter","question":"向量ACL为什么要在排序前过滤？","aliases":["先向量排序再过滤owner可以吗"],"keywords":["向量ACL","排序前","过滤owner"],"diagnostic":"检查WHERE owner是否进入同一查询。","hints":["查看 #concept-exact-hnsw-filter。","无权向量不能进候选。"],"example":"WHERE owner_id AND index_id。","answer":"排序后过滤会让无权内容进入候选和执行路径；owner必须在查询条件中前置。","source":{"label":"精确HNSW与过滤","href":"#concept-exact-hnsw-filter"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"index-states","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-03","context_id":"example-index-rebuild-switch","question":"向量索引有哪些生命周期状态？","aliases":["building ready active retired怎么流转"],"keywords":["向量索引","生命周期","building","ready","active","retired"],"diagnostic":"沿构建、验证、服务和退役顺序检查。","hints":["查看 #example-index-rebuild-switch。","只有ready可activate。"],"example":"building→ready→active→retired。","answer":"依次是building、ready、active和retired；失败构建不能激活。","source":{"label":"索引重建切换","href":"#example-index-rebuild-switch"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"atomic-switch","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-03","context_id":"example-index-rebuild-switch","question":"Active index怎样原子切换？","aliases":["怎样保证只有一个active向量索引"],"keywords":["Active index","原子切换","一个active"],"diagnostic":"检查唯一部分索引和单事务更新。","hints":["查看 #example-index-rebuild-switch。","旧retired与新active同事务。"],"example":"v1 retired + v2 active。","answer":"在同一事务退役旧索引并激活ready新索引，数据库唯一部分索引限制只能有一个active。","source":{"label":"索引重建切换","href":"#example-index-rebuild-switch"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"incremental-upsert","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-03","context_id":"modify-add-index-rebuild","question":"同一chunk增量更新怎样避免重复？","aliases":["向量upsert的唯一键是什么"],"keywords":["同一chunk","增量更新","向量upsert","唯一键"],"diagnostic":"检查index_id和chunk_id复合主键。","hints":["查看 #modify-add-index-rebuild。","同index内覆盖同chunk。"],"example":"PRIMARY KEY(index_id,chunk_id)。","answer":"使用index ID加chunk ID作为唯一身份，同索引内upsert，不影响其他索引版本。","source":{"label":"增加可恢复重建","href":"#modify-add-index-rebuild"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"vector-type-order","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-03","context_id":"troubleshoot-pgvector-index","question":"为什么要先创建vector扩展再注册psycopg？","aliases":["vector type not found怎么修"],"keywords":["创建vector扩展","注册psycopg","vector type not found"],"diagnostic":"检查数据库类型是否存在。","hints":["查看 #troubleshoot-pgvector-index。","先迁移再register_vector。"],"example":"CREATE EXTENSION vector。","answer":"psycopg注册会查询数据库vector类型；扩展未创建时类型不存在。","source":{"label":"pgvector排错","href":"#troubleshoot-pgvector-index"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"vector-adapter","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-03","context_id":"troubleshoot-pgvector-index","question":"向量参数为什么要用pgvector Vector？","aliases":["tuple写vector为什么格式错误"],"keywords":["向量参数","pgvector Vector","tuple","格式错误"],"diagnostic":"检查参数适配类型。","hints":["查看 #troubleshoot-pgvector-index。","不要依赖tuple文本格式。"],"example":"Vector([1,0,0])。","answer":"显式Vector适配器按vector二进制/文本协议编码，普通tuple可能被当成PostgreSQL数组或记录。","source":{"label":"pgvector排错","href":"#troubleshoot-pgvector-index"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"real-model-boundary","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-03","context_id":"deepen-provider-index-boundary","question":"换真实embedding模型时索引怎么处理？","aliases":["换供应方能覆盖旧向量吗"],"keywords":["真实embedding模型","索引","换供应方","覆盖旧向量"],"diagnostic":"检查是否建立新契约和index。","hints":["查看 #deepen-provider-index-boundary。","固定查询评估后再切换。"],"example":"build idx-v2 then activate。","answer":"建立新契约和新index，完整构建评估后原子切换，不能覆盖旧空间。","source":{"label":"模型与索引边界","href":"#deepen-provider-index-boundary"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":false},
